```yaml
apiVersion: v3.1.0
kind: DataContract
id: urn:datacontract:fraud:silver-attempt-histories
name: Silver payment attempt histories
version: 1.0.0
status: active
domain: fraud-detection
description:
  purpose: Scoped attempt histories and explicit incomplete payment context.
  usage: Resolve event identities through canonical events and filter pending context where complete history is required.
  limitations: The history is not a predecision feature vector.
team:
  name: Fraud data platform
  members:
  - username: xuanphuc.a1gv
    role: owner
schema:
- name: attempt_histories
  physicalName: silver.attempt_histories
  logicalType: object
  physicalType: table
  description: One scoped payment attempt with ordered canonical event references.
  properties:
  - {name: integration_id, logicalType: string, physicalType: string, required: true, description: Integration identity.}
  - {name: payment_id, logicalType: string, physicalType: string, required: true, description: Scoped payment identity.}
  - {name: attempt_id, logicalType: string, physicalType: string, required: true, description: Scoped attempt identity.}
  - name: events
    logicalType: array
    required: true
    description: Event references ordered by aggregate version and event identity.
    items:
      logicalType: object
      properties:
      - {name: sequence, logicalType: integer, physicalType: long, required: true, description: Aggregate version.}
      - {name: event_id, logicalType: string, physicalType: string, required: true, description: Canonical event identity.}
      - {name: occurred_at, logicalType: timestamp, physicalType: timestamp, required: true, description: Event occurrence time.}
  - {name: started_events, logicalType: integer, physicalType: long, required: true, description: Number of attempt start events.}
  - {name: attempt_started_at, logicalType: timestamp, physicalType: timestamp, description: Attempt start when available.}
  - {name: created_events, logicalType: integer, physicalType: long, required: true, description: Number of payment creation events.}
  - {name: terminal_events, logicalType: integer, physicalType: long, required: true, description: Number of terminal payment events.}
  - {name: payment_first_version, logicalType: integer, physicalType: long, required: true, description: Earliest selected aggregate version.}
  - {name: payment_last_version, logicalType: integer, physicalType: long, required: true, description: Latest selected aggregate version.}
  - {name: payment_event_count, logicalType: integer, physicalType: long, required: true, description: Number of selected canonical payment events.}
  - {name: pending_context, logicalType: boolean, physicalType: boolean, required: true, description: True when required payment or attempt context has not arrived.}
  - {name: _candidate_id, logicalType: string, physicalType: string, required: true, description: Candidate that last changed this row; the accepted receipt identifies the complete snapshot.}

```

ODCS id=urn:datacontract:fraud:silver-label-observations version=1.0.0 sha256=74bc39bfdbe47dee42ab79d0471ace29852c981ffae4a0acb19e7a9ea8a317f2

Source revision: [8d7971bb556202b36237dfaaedbc20e3a5dfbfe8](https://github.com/phuchoang2603/payment-gateway-fraud-detection/blob/8d7971bb556202b36237dfaaedbc20e3a5dfbfe8/contracts/data-products/silver-payments/label-observations.odcs.yaml)

```yaml
apiVersion: v3.1.0
kind: DataContract
id: urn:datacontract:fraud:silver-label-observations
name: Silver label observations
version: 1.0.0
status: active
domain: fraud-detection
description:
  purpose: Independent simulation-truth and chargeback observations with availability times.
  usage: Read accepted snapshots and use labels only at or after label_available_at.
  limitations: Missing chargebacks are unknown; scenario and future outcomes are not predecision features.
team:
  name: Fraud data platform
  members:
  - username: xuanphuc.a1gv
    role: owner
schema:
- name: label_observations
  physicalName: silver.label_observations
  logicalType: object
  physicalType: table
  description: One normalized distinct source observation per scoped attempt and canonical observation hash.
  properties:
  - {name: integration_id, logicalType: string, physicalType: string, required: true, description: Integration identity.}
  - {name: payment_id, logicalType: string, physicalType: string, required: true, description: Scoped payment identity.}
  - {name: attempt_id, logicalType: string, physicalType: string, required: true, description: Scoped attempt identity.}
  - {name: observation_id, logicalType: string, physicalType: string, required: true, description: "SHA-256 of UTF-8 Spark JSON with null fields included and UTC timestamps formatted yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ss.SSSSSSXXX; struct fields are ordered integration_id, payment_id, attempt_id, is_fraud, occurred_at, label_available_at, source, scenario."}
  - {name: is_fraud, logicalType: boolean, physicalType: boolean, required: true, description: Truth according to the declared source.}
  - {name: occurred_at, logicalType: timestamp, physicalType: timestamp, required: true, description: Labeled business occurrence time.}
  - {name: label_available_at, logicalType: timestamp, physicalType: timestamp, required: true, description: Earliest time the observation may be used.}
  - {name: source, logicalType: string, physicalType: string, required: true, description: Simulation truth or chargeback source.}
  - {name: scenario, logicalType: string, physicalType: string, description: Synthetic scenario on simulation truth only and never a predecision feature.}
  - {name: attempt_started_at, logicalType: timestamp, physicalType: timestamp, description: Start time when linked attempt context is complete.}
  - {name: payment_succeeded_at, logicalType: timestamp, physicalType: timestamp, description: Success time when the linked attempt succeeded.}
  - {name: pending_context, logicalType: boolean, physicalType: boolean, required: true, description: True while required attempt or success context is missing.}
  - {name: _candidate_id, logicalType: string, physicalType: string, required: true, description: Candidate that last changed this row; the accepted receipt identifies the complete snapshot.}

```
